# Local-only Python viewer/streaming tooling (rhizo_server.py, rhizo_viewer.py, the bridges) —
# keep it out of the Vercel build context so Python auto-detection
# doesn't run "uv pip install" on packages that need local GL/audio libs.
*.py
requirements.txt

# Not needed to build the site
*.docx
src-tauri/
tests/
coverage/
